World Magnetic Model coefficient data for imud
 Coefficient file (WMM.COF) for the World Magnetic Model, a joint product of
 the United States' National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency (NGA) and the
 United Kingdom's Defence Geographic Centre (DGC), distributed by NOAA/NCEI.
 imud uses it to compute magnetic declination from a position fix, giving
 true heading with no network access. Packaged separately (like tzdata) so a
 new five-year model epoch can be shipped without touching the daemon.
 Architecture-independent data.
